  "fastvep_measured_note": "fastVEP v0.3.0 (ARM 6d83c5bc, x86 e123fbc0) was measured in sweep-20260918T224520Z on both architectures; its two structural-variant concordance rows are scored in this sweep (sweep-20260920T012411Z), whose structural-variant inputs differ from that campaign's, and its six SNP and indel rows in manuscript/data/f1_observations_fastvep.csv carry sweep_id=sweep-20260918T224520Z. fastVEP F1 is architecture-independent; the SV comparator maps fastVEP's symbolic alleles to VEP's Sequence Ontology class names before scoring (compare_sv_concordance.py --scored-engine fastvep).",
