  "policy": "universal_ensembl_style",
  "provenance_sha_note": "The clone bootstrap that stages the data and runs run_clone_measurement.sh emits one rolled dataset_inventory_sha256 per clone (a single roll-up over the staged vcf, caches, reference and ground_truth trees) rather than per-artifact cache, FASTA and input-VCF SHAs. That rolled hash is the reproducibility pin: the vep-rs cohort rolled 15c55e95 identically on all 40 clones across both arches (parity_ok, determinism_ok). Each clone's copy is at results/<arch>/clone-<n>/inventory.sha256.",
